Job Description
• Lead a work stream in the development of enterprise architecture and collaborate with other teams to develop the business architecture, technology architecture, data architecture, application architecture, and security architecture;
• Collaborate with stakeholders to develop and implement enterprise architecture strategies aligned with the organization's goals and objectives;
• Analyse business requirements, technical landscapes, and emerging technologies to develop enterprise architecture roadmaps;
• Assess the current state and develop the target state of the organization's business processes, IT landscape and systems to identify gaps and opportunities for improvement;
• Develop architectural models, diagrams, documentation and artefacts;
• Evaluate and select enterprise architecture tools;
• Contribute in project planning including defining project scope, estimating resources and creating timelines;
• Collaborate with IT professionals to evaluate new technologies and making recommendations for their adoption;
• Support presales activities such as presentation, proposal writing, demonstration and proof-of-concept;
• Stay updated on industry trends and emerging technologies related to enterprise architecture; and
• Coach, guide and mentor work stream team members.
