• Minimum Bachelor Degree or higher from a reputable universities
• Minimum 4 years of working experience in IT industry of which 2 years are in Systems Analyst, Business Analyst, Solution Architect or Transformation Change Management related roles in vendor or consulting environment
• Skills in modelling language such as UML and BPMN is an advantage
• Excellent presentation and demonstration skills
• Excellent skills in consultative engagement approach with clients
• Excellent written and oral communications skills, and documentation writing skills in English and/or BM.
• Passionate and possess strong business acumen, have strategic thinking ability in business technology impacts and to ‘Think Technical/Technology but Speak and Write Business language’.
• Excellent communication skills in articulating information to various organization levels (from users to C-levels) and have ability to actively involved in high profile consultation engagements.
• Excellent inter-personal skills and ability to lead and guide team
• Independent, results oriented and self-starter with ability to work with minimal supervision and possess strong passion to learn/re-learn.

