Experience with seamless/automated build scripts and highly automated infrastructure;
Experience with containers platforms (Docker EE or Openshift) and orchestration (Swarm, Azure Kubernetes or AWS Elastic Kubernetes);
Experience with DevOps frameworks like release engineering ,advanced test automation, infrastructure as code, self-healing, technical debt, toil elimination and chaos engineering;
Knowledge of Kubernetes best practices to facilitate the digital and cloud-enabled transformations and reduce the lead time for production migration;
Working knowledge of Linux/Windows OS administration in a cloud or virtualization environments;
Exceptional interpersonal and communication skills to effectively interact with both internal and external stakeholders.
