Good English writing skills.
Ability to work with little supervision, to meet deadlines, to solve problems, and to make appropriate recommendations is required.
Well versed with the risk management framework, methodologies and corporate governance practices.
Excellent analytical, problem-solving, and decision-making skills.
Possess good communication skills with all levels of management and stakeholders.
A strong team player & innovative & always seek for improvements
Strong project management skills, with the ability to manage multiple tasks and deadlines effectively

