Strong knowledge and experience in treasury, trade settlements and funds movement processes;
Excellent time management and organizational skills;
Diligent and detail-minded;
Team player with demonstrated ability to communicate and partner with internal / external parties;
Fluency in English and Mandarin is advantageous, due to need to work closely with Mandarin as well as English speaking stakeholders.
