We are looking for an HSE Officer to join the Project Owner’s EPCM team for our LSS CGPP project in Sungai Petani, Kedah. Interested applicants will be required to commit to 12-month long contract for this role.
If you have a strong technical understanding of solar photovoltaic and excel in a fast-paced environment, we look forward to receiving your application!
Your work will include:
Supervising and co-ordinating all aspects of Health, Safety, Security and Environmental (HSSE) and Environmental & Social Management System (ESMS) activities conducted by the EPC Contractor;
Enforcing all aspects of HSSE & ESMS rules and regulations onto the EPC Contractor, and provide technical support to ib vogt’s site teams on all HSE aspects and issues;
Ensuring all ib vogt GmbH’s standard rules and guidelines on HSSE & ESMS are made known to the EPC Contractor and to be followed and implemented accordingly;
Reviewing all documentation related to HSSE and ESMS submitted by EPC Contractor, and propose appropriate measures or revisions if required;
Arranging meetings, routine check-ups and audits on the HSSE and ESMS measures on site and represent the Project Owner in meetings for all HSSE and ESMS related issues;
Logistics, material acceptance and material handover to the contractors;
Ensuring compliance by the EPC Contractor on all HSE, ESMS as per authorities regulatory acts and safety procedures, including enforcement of all mandatory safety measures;
